Spec: Windows owned runtime verification

Purpose:
  Verify exact argument handling and kernel-enforced process-tree cleanup with actual child processes.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Processes.Tests.csproj
  ./Program.cs

Must:
  Use only the fixture executable and owned artifact directories; never terminate unrelated processes.
  Verify wrong digest rejection, quoted argument preservation, explicit Job disposal and owner-crash cleanup.
